  "descriptionHtml": "<div class=\"product-highlights\" style=\"margin-bottom:16px;\"><span style=\"display:inline-block;background:#f3f4f6;color:#1f2937;padding:3px 10px;border-radius:12px;font-size:12px;margin:2px 4px 2px 0;font-weight:500;\">✓ Natural Finish</span><span style=\"display:inline-block;background:#f3f4f6;color:#1f2937;padding:3px 10px;border-radius:12px;font-size:12px;margin:2px 4px 2px 0;font-weight:500;\">✓ Good for: Acne/Blemishes</span><span style=\"display:inline-block;background:#f3f4f6;color:#1f2937;padding:3px 10px;border-radius:12px;font-size:12px;margin:2px 4px 2px 0;font-weight:500;\">✓ Clean at Sephora</span><span style=\"display:inline-block;background:#f3f4f6;color:#1f2937;padding:3px 10px;border-radius:12px;font-size:12px;margin:2px 4px 2px 0;font-weight:500;\">✓ Medium Coverage</span><span style=\"display:inline-block;background:#f3f4f6;color:#1f2937;padding:3px 10px;border-radius:12px;font-size:12px;margin:2px 4px 2px 0;font-weight:500;\">✓ Long-wearing</span><span style=\"display:inline-block;background:#f3f4f6;color:#1f2937;padding:3px 10px;border-radius:12px;font-size:12px;margin:2px 4px 2px 0;font-weight:500;\">✓ Non-Comedogenic</span></div>\n<div class=\"product-description-main\" style=\"margin-bottom:20px;line-height:1.6;\"><p><strong>What it is: </strong>A sensitive-skin friendly, non-acnegenic, medium-buildable coverage featherweight serum foundation with up to 16-hour long-wear.</p><p><br></p><p><strong>Coverage: </strong>Medium</p><p><strong><br>Formulation: </strong>Liquid</p><p><br></p></div>\n<details class=\"size-guide-accordion\" style=\"margin-top:16px;border-top:1px solid #e5e7eb;padding-top:12px;\"><summary style=\"font-weight:600;font-size:15px;cursor:pointer;padding:6px 0;outline:none;display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center;\"><span>How to Use</span><span style=\"font-size:18px;color:#6b7280;\">+</span></summary><div style=\"padding:12px 0 6px 0;line-height:1.6;color:#374151;\"><p><strong>Suggested Usage:<br></strong></p><p>- Always shake well before use.&nbsp;</p><p>- Start with one pump for light coverage and build as needed.&nbsp;</p><p>- Apply to moisturized skin with fingers, a brush, or beauty sponge.&nbsp;</p><p><br></p><p>- For dry skin, use a nourishing moisturizer; for combo or oily skin, use a lightweight moisturizer and let it absorb first.&nbsp;</p><p>- Build coverage where needed, then follow with Swipe Serum Concealer (sold separately) for true medium coverage on blemishes or under the eyes.</p><p>- Allow the foundation to settle before adding or layering powder.&nbsp;</p><p>- Using a powder puff or sponge, press GetSet pressed setting powder (sold separately) into the T-zone or other shine-prone areas.</p></div></details>\n<details class=\"size-guide-accordion\" style=\"margin-top:12px;border-top:1px solid #e5e7eb;border-bottom:1px solid #e5e7eb;padding:12px 0;\"><summary style=\"font-weight:600;font-size:15px;cursor:pointer;padding:6px 0;outline:none;display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center;\"><span>Ingredients</span><span style=\"font-size:18px;color:#6b7280;\">+</span></summary><div style=\"padding:12px 0 6px 0;line-height:1.6;color:#374151;font-size:13px;\">-Portulaca Oleracea Extract: Antimicrobial to calm irritation and keep breakout-causing bacteria in check.<br>-Fermented Oat: Deeply hydrates and maintains a healthy-looking skin barrier.<br>-Lactobacillus Ferment: Soothes skin and defends against environmental stressors.<br><br>Water/Aqua/Eau, C15-19 Alkane, Caprylic/Capric Triglyceride, Dicaprylyl Carbonate, Propanediol, Silica, Glycerin, Polyglyceryl-3 Polyricinoleate, Glyceryl Hydrogenated Rosinate, Panthenol, Shorea Robusta Resin, Oryza Sativa (Rice) Starch, Sodium Chloride, Octyldodecanol, Stearalkonium Hectorite, Dextrin Palmitate, Magnesium Sulfate, Polyglyceryl-3 Diisostearate, Diisostearyl Malate, Squalane, Propylene Carbonate, Sodium Dehydroacetate, Sodium Myristoyl Glutamate, Polyglycerin-3, Tocopheryl Acetate, Ophiopogon Japonicus Root Extract, Polyhydroxystearic Acid, Portulaca Oleracea Extract, Aluminum Hydroxide, Lactobacillus Ferment, Ricinoleic Acid, Maltodextrin, Avena Sativa (Oat) Leaf Extract, Isostearic Acid, Citric Acid, Lecithin, Tocopherol, Saccharomyces Ferment Lysate Filtrate, Sodium Benzoate, Potassium Sorbate,). May Contain/Peut Contenir [+/-]: Titanium Dioxide (CI 77891), Iron Oxides (CI 77491, CI 77492, CI 77499). <br><br><i>The list of ingredients is subject to change. Please consult the packaging of the product purchased.</i></div></details>",
  "description_html": "<div class=\"product-highlights\" style=\"margin-bottom:16px;\"><span style=\"display:inline-block;background:#f3f4f6;color:#1f2937;padding:3px 10px;border-radius:12px;font-size:12px;margin:2px 4px 2px 0;font-weight:500;\">✓ Natural Finish</span><span style=\"display:inline-block;background:#f3f4f6;color:#1f2937;padding:3px 10px;border-radius:12px;font-size:12px;margin:2px 4px 2px 0;font-weight:500;\">✓ Good for: Acne/Blemishes</span><span style=\"display:inline-block;background:#f3f4f6;color:#1f2937;padding:3px 10px;border-radius:12px;font-size:12px;margin:2px 4px 2px 0;font-weight:500;\">✓ Clean at Sephora</span><span style=\"display:inline-block;background:#f3f4f6;color:#1f2937;padding:3px 10px;border-radius:12px;font-size:12px;margin:2px 4px 2px 0;font-weight:500;\">✓ Medium Coverage</span><span style=\"display:inline-block;background:#f3f4f6;color:#1f2937;padding:3px 10px;border-radius:12px;font-size:12px;margin:2px 4px 2px 0;font-weight:500;\">✓ Long-wearing</span><span style=\"display:inline-block;background:#f3f4f6;color:#1f2937;padding:3px 10px;border-radius:12px;font-size:12px;margin:2px 4px 2px 0;font-weight:500;\">✓ Non-Comedogenic</span></div>\n<div class=\"product-description-main\" style=\"margin-bottom:20px;line-height:1.6;\"><p><strong>What it is: </strong>A sensitive-skin friendly, non-acnegenic, medium-buildable coverage featherweight serum foundation with up to 16-hour long-wear.</p><p><br></p><p><strong>Coverage: </strong>Medium</p><p><strong><br>Formulation: </strong>Liquid</p><p><br></p></div>\n<details class=\"size-guide-accordion\" style=\"margin-top:16px;border-top:1px solid #e5e7eb;padding-top:12px;\"><summary style=\"font-weight:600;font-size:15px;cursor:pointer;padding:6px 0;outline:none;display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center;\"><span>How to Use</span><span style=\"font-size:18px;color:#6b7280;\">+</span></summary><div style=\"padding:12px 0 6px 0;line-height:1.6;color:#374151;\"><p><strong>Suggested Usage:<br></strong></p><p>- Always shake well before use.&nbsp;</p><p>- Start with one pump for light coverage and build as needed.&nbsp;</p><p>- Apply to moisturized skin with fingers, a brush, or beauty sponge.&nbsp;</p><p><br></p><p>- For dry skin, use a nourishing moisturizer; for combo or oily skin, use a lightweight moisturizer and let it absorb first.&nbsp;</p><p>- Build coverage where needed, then follow with Swipe Serum Concealer (sold separately) for true medium coverage on blemishes or under the eyes.</p><p>- Allow the foundation to settle before adding or layering powder.&nbsp;</p><p>- Using a powder puff or sponge, press GetSet pressed setting powder (sold separately) into the T-zone or other shine-prone areas.</p></div></details>\n<details class=\"size-guide-accordion\" style=\"margin-top:12px;border-top:1px solid #e5e7eb;border-bottom:1px solid #e5e7eb;padding:12px 0;\"><summary style=\"font-weight:600;font-size:15px;cursor:pointer;padding:6px 0;outline:none;display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center;\"><span>Ingredients</span><span style=\"font-size:18px;color:#6b7280;\">+</span></summary><div style=\"padding:12px 0 6px 0;line-height:1.6;color:#374151;font-size:13px;\">-Portulaca Oleracea Extract: Antimicrobial to calm irritation and keep breakout-causing bacteria in check.<br>-Fermented Oat: Deeply hydrates and maintains a healthy-looking skin barrier.<br>-Lactobacillus Ferment: Soothes skin and defends against environmental stressors.<br><br>Water/Aqua/Eau, C15-19 Alkane, Caprylic/Capric Triglyceride, Dicaprylyl Carbonate, Propanediol, Silica, Glycerin, Polyglyceryl-3 Polyricinoleate, Glyceryl Hydrogenated Rosinate, Panthenol, Shorea Robusta Resin, Oryza Sativa (Rice) Starch, Sodium Chloride, Octyldodecanol, Stearalkonium Hectorite, Dextrin Palmitate, Magnesium Sulfate, Polyglyceryl-3 Diisostearate, Diisostearyl Malate, Squalane, Propylene Carbonate, Sodium Dehydroacetate, Sodium Myristoyl Glutamate, Polyglycerin-3, Tocopheryl Acetate, Ophiopogon Japonicus Root Extract, Polyhydroxystearic Acid, Portulaca Oleracea Extract, Aluminum Hydroxide, Lactobacillus Ferment, Ricinoleic Acid, Maltodextrin, Avena Sativa (Oat) Leaf Extract, Isostearic Acid, Citric Acid, Lecithin, Tocopherol, Saccharomyces Ferment Lysate Filtrate, Sodium Benzoate, Potassium Sorbate,). May Contain/Peut Contenir [+/-]: Titanium Dioxide (CI 77891), Iron Oxides (CI 77491, CI 77492, CI 77499). <br><br><i>The list of ingredients is subject to change. Please consult the packaging of the product purchased.</i></div></details>",
